findings.suggestion:
在执行删除前强制鉴权与授权：从会话令牌解析调用方身份（拒绝 401），并要求其为管理员或该帖作者，否则返回 403。示例：
identity = require_authenticated(request)  # 无有效令牌时 401
if not (identity.role == "admin" or post.author == identity.name):
    return {"status": 403, "body": {"message": "forbidden"}}

findings.evidence:
app/api/posts.py:41-51
def handle_delete_post(request):
    post_id = int(request.get("post_id", 0))
    deleted = post_service.delete_post(post_id, requester=request.get("username"))
    if not deleted:
        return {"status": 404, "body": {"message": "帖子不存在"}}
    return {"status": 200, "body": {"deleted": post_id}}

findings.suggestion:
改为参数化查询，不拼接：
return ("SELECT id, title, author FROM posts WHERE tags LIKE ?", f"%{tag}%")
执行时由驱动绑定参数；如必须转义，也应对 LIKE 通配符 % 和 _ 做处理。
